------------------------------ MODULE I ------------------------------
VARIABLE x

Init == x \in {1,2,3,4,5}

N[i] == UNCHANGED <<x>>

Next == \/ i \in {1,2,3} : N[i]

F == [i \in {1,2,3,4,5} |-> IF i = 1 THEN 1 ELSE F[i-1] + 1]

Inv == \E i \in {1,2,3,4,5} : F[i] = x

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_x /\ Inv
===============================================================================